      ":question/problem": "Calculate $(A-B)-C$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 5 & -4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First calculate the left-hand difference:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-B & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-4 & 5-4 & -4-(-5) \\\\ -1-1 & 3-5 & -2-4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubtract the third matrix entry by entry:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A-B)-C & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5-5 & 1-1 & 1-(-3) \\\\ -2-(-1) & -2-(-3) & -6-(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 & 0 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
